{"ts": "2026-11-18T15:34:35+00:00", "id": "T001", "language": "nl", "category": "question", "priority": "P2", "action": "reply", "confidence": 0.95, "faq_ids": ["F01"], "back_translation": "Hi Marloes, You can easily regain access to your account by going to app.roosterly.nl/login and clicking on \"Wachtwoord vergeten\". Enter your email address there. The reset link you receive is valid for 60 minutes. Haven't received an email within 10 minutes? Then check your spam folder to be sure. Best regards, Roosterly", "outcome": "posted", "error": null, "tokens": {"input": 6381, "output": 1611}}
