{"ts": "2026-11-18T15:35:33+00:00", "id": "T005", "language": "nl", "category": "question", "priority": "P4", "action": "reply", "confidence": 1, "faq_ids": ["F02"], "back_translation": "Good morning Anouk, You can add a new employee as follows: Go to Team → Add employee, enter the name, email address and contract hours and click on Invite. The employee will then receive an email to install the app. Kind regards, Roosterly", "outcome": "posted", "error": null, "tokens": {"input": 5738, "output": 1126}}
