{"ts": "2026-11-18T15:37:20+00:00", "id": "T015", "language": "nl", "category": "question", "priority": "P4", "action": "reply", "confidence": 1, "faq_ids": ["F04", "F05"], "back_translation": "Yes, Roosterly can export approved hours to Loket.nl (and to Nmbrs, AFAS or as a CSV file). The integration with Loket.nl is part of the Plus plan. You can set this up under Settings → Integrations → Payroll. The export runs per pay period (week, four weeks or month). If you currently have the Basis plan, you can upgrade to Plus at any time via Settings → Subscription. The new price takes effect from the next invoice.", "outcome": "posted", "error": null, "tokens": {"input": 6222, "output": 1665}}
{"ts": "2026-11-18T15:37:30+00:00", "id": "T016", "language": "en", "category": "feature_request", "priority": "P4", "action": "handoff", "confidence": 0.95, "faq_ids": null, "back_translation": null, "outcome": "posted", "error": null, "tokens": {"input": 5493, "output": 656}}
